 class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 36.5pt; text-align: center;">TORO CORP.</div><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 36.5pt; text-align: center;">PROSPECTUS</div><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 60.5pt; text-align: center;">Maxim Group LLC</div><div class="fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 233.5pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#8195;</div></div></div><div class="block-frill" style="width: 456pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div><div class="rule-full" style="height: 0pt; width: 100%; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000; margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"> </div><div class="rule-full" style="height: 0pt; width: 100%; border-bottom: 2pt solid #000000; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; margin-top: 4pt;"> </div></div></div></div>
